| `crates/server/tests/bots/seat.rs` | change | New private `struct MissTally` and `fn miss_tally(game: usize) -> MissTally` (one game's counts, the old loop body). `r2214000_a_strength_zero_miss_makes_far_fewer_beginners_mistakes_than_random` runs `miss_tally` for each game on `std::thread::scope` threads and sums the results. |

Do not touch:
- `.github/` (no matrix change is needed, and the bot may not change it)
- `spec/` (the R2214000 note and its `proven_in` stay as they are)
