This is governed by ruling R2214000 (`spec/rulings/R2214000.md`; seat.rs is already in its `proven_in`, and the test keeps its name) and by CLAUDE.md's CI section (the five-minute budget). CLAUDE.md rule 4 (purity) does not cover `crates/server`. `practice.rs`'s `honest_win` already uses `std::thread::scope` the same way.

## Steps

